  "messages": [
    {
      "content": "Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\boxed{}.\n\nWhat overtime multiplier applies to Mark's weekend work? Mark used to make $11 per hour.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "LOSSY SELF-SUMMARY; VERIFY AGAINST NEW INPUTS\nVISIBLE PREFIX THROUGH TURN 6; LOSSY EXTRACT:\n- {\"content\":\"Good, now using that, can you calculate: How much money does Mark make in one week? One more thing you should know: Mark's pay was raised by $2 per hour.\",\"role\":\"user\"}\n- {\"content\":\"Mark’s new regular hourly rate is:\\n\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\$10+\\\\$2=\\\\$12\\\\text{/hour}\\n\\\\]\\n\\nAssuming overtime begins after 40 hours per week:\\n\\n- **Regular pay:**  \\n  \\\\[\\n  40 \\\\times \\\\$12=\\\\$480\\n  \\\\]\\n\\n- **Overtime rate:**  \\n...\n- {\"content\":\"One more thing — Mark's employer pays 1.5 times the regular hourly rate for weekend work.\",\"role\":\"user\"}\n- {\"content\":\"Mark’s new regular rate is:\\n\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\$10+\\\\$2=\\\\$12\\\\text{/hour}\\n\\\\]\\n\\nAssuming he works **five weekdays and one weekend day**, and the weekend rate is **1.5×** the regular rate:\\n\\n- **Weekday pay:**  \\n  \\\\[\\n  5 \\\\ti...",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Actually, that was wrong. Mark works 8 hours a day for 5 days a week.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "The overtime multiplier for Mark’s weekend work is **1.5× his regular hourly rate**.\n\nSince he works 8 hours a day for 5 days a week, he works **40 hours per week** and has no scheduled weekend work. Thus:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1.5\\times}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    }
  ],
