  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "1. Mark’s former wage of \\$11 per hour is only his **base hourly rate**.\n2. An overtime multiplier depends on the employer’s policy or applicable labor law.\n3. Weekend work does not automatically have a specific multiplier; it may be regular pay, 1.5× pay, or another rate.\n\nThus, the information given is insufficient to determine the multiplier. If the standard “time-and-a-half” rule applies, the multiplier would be \\(1.5\\times\\), giving an overtime rate of \\(11 \\times 1.5=\\$16.50\\) per hour.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{The multiplier cannot be determined from the given information; if standard overtime applies, it is }1.5\\times.}\n\\]",
